#Usages:
# weak: common, should usually be combined with another weak
# mild: common, stand-alone
# severe: rare
# extreme: very rare, event has to have a massive impact and must be rather rare / unique
# ultimate: legendarily rare, should only be used for impressive feats or massive failures only
# radical: rarest value you could get

